  "instructions": [
    "Season the chicken with part of the ginger, salt, and pepper and let it stand while the rice is rinsed.",
    "Bring the rice and water to a boil, then simmer gently until the grains break down into porridge.",
    "Stir the marinated chicken into the porridge and simmer until it reaches 165°F.",
    "Add the remaining ginger and green onions and stir briefly.",
    "Ladle the congee into bowls and finish each serving with cilantro."
